    <node id="&quot;MAC MCDONALD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mac McDonald, born Terence McDonald, is an American actor known for roles in TV series and movies, and was born in Long Island, New York."</data>
